  "bodyHash": "0DpRaBCngo0=",
  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/MIqTqet.png\" width=\"542\" height=\"194\"><br><br></strong><strong><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fKingybu\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/4fnAZgM.png\" width=\"331\" height=\"34\"></a><br></strong></strong><strong><strong style=\"text-align:center\">厌倦了 Minecraft 那单调的基础用户界面？</strong></strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><strong style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/hM7UhuRFaa\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/lvIL7Aa.png\" width=\"185\" height=\"37\"></a></strong></strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><strong style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/kingybu\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/cqteEYQ.png\" width=\"202\" height=\"39\"></a></strong></strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.instagram.com%252fkingybusiness%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/2b2cGRW.png\" width=\"187\" height=\"30\"></a></strong></p><p><strong>厌倦了靠近附魔台却看到和合成台一样的灰色界面？想为你的游戏增添一些色彩？彩色容器登场，现在支持暗色模式！</strong></p><p><strong>这是一个容器 GUI 替换模组，旨在让每个菜单与 Minecraft 中色彩缤纷的可交互方块相匹配。<br>抛开调侃不谈，这个纹理包将替换所有方块（如合成台、熔炉）的 GUI。每个新菜单的设计灵感都来自其对应的方块，有些甚至带有动画！<br></strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/optigui\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/QhUZf5G.png\" width=\"413\" height=\"30\"></a><br></strong>或 <strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252foptifine.net%252fdownloads\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Optifine</a><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/572we2z.png\"><br></strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 合成台&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 末影箱&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;铁砧 &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/CZBBaAo.png\"></p>\n</div><p style=\"text-align:left\"><br><strong>请仔细阅读以下内容！</strong></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>如果<strong>使用了 OptiGUI 或 Optifine</strong>，请选择\"Modded\"语言以防止出现错误<br><br>如果<strong>未使用 OptiGUI 或 Optifine</strong>，请选择\"Vanilla（原版）\"语言以正确显示箱子和其他纹理！<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/VffXUn6.png\"></p>\n</div><p style=\"text-align:left\"><br><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/syZkvjR.png\" width=\"72\" height=\"27\"><br>- 合成配方书<br>- 铁砧<br>- 高炉<br>- 酿造台<br>- 制图台<br>- 合成器<br>- 箱子（大箱子、小箱子、末影箱）<strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/KpcLE4g.png\" width=\"120\" height=\"27\"></strong><br>- 工作台<br>- 发射器<br>- 投掷器<strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/KpcLE4g.png\" width=\"120\" height=\"27\"></strong><br>- 附魔台<br>- 熔炉<br>- 砂轮<br>- 漏斗<br>- 织布机<br>- 潜影盒（所有颜色）<strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/KpcLE4g.png\" width=\"120\" height=\"27\"></strong><br>- 烟熏炉<br>- 切石机<br>- 锻造台<br>- 木桶<br>- 村民职业<strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/KpcLE4g.png\" width=\"120\" height=\"27\"></strong><br>- 信标&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><strong>此外还有</strong><br>- 暗色加载界面 <strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/MD7GkQB.png\" width=\"82\" height=\"15\"></strong><br>- 暗色进度菜单<br>-<span style=\"text-align:center\">生存模式背包&nbsp;<br></span></p><p><span style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/RtheOPo.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"31\"></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>-<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">为什么有些纹理无法正常显示？</span><br></strong>请确保你已安装 <strong>Optifine</strong> 或 <strong>OptiGUI 和 Animatica</strong>。由于 Optifine 的限制，某些纹理（如矿车和带箱子的船）的 GUI 只能通过 OptiGUI 正常工作。<br>我始终推荐使用 <strong>OptiGUI</strong> 和 <strong>Animatica</strong> 来替代 Optifine！<br><br><strong>-<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">我可以在我的整合包中添加你的纹理包吗？</span><br>可以</strong>，你可以在你的 Modrinth 或 Curseforge 整合包中添加我的任何纹理包，<strong>前提是</strong>要注明我的贡献，并将我的纹理包列为依赖项。<strong><br></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>-<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">如何提交关于模组支持或其他内容的建议？</span><br></strong>你可以在 <strong><a href=\"https://discord.gg/hM7UhuRFaa\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord 服务器</a></strong> 上提交建议！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>-<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">某个功能不正常或有疑问怎么办？</span><br></strong>你猜对了！请在我们<strong><a href=\"https://discord.gg/hM7UhuRFaa\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord 服务器</a></strong> 上寻求帮助！</span></p>\n</div><p style=\"text-align:left\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/iabKPjs.png\" width=\"323\" height=\"33\"><br>- 带箱子的木筏 <strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/PLg8xaL.png\" width=\"67\" height=\"14\"></strong><br>- 带箱子的船 <strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/PLg8xaL.png\" width=\"67\" height=\"14\"></strong></p><p><strong><strong style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Vu4XFTD.png\" width=\"261\" height=\"36\"><br></strong></strong><span style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-align:center\">- 创造模式物品栏</span></span><strong><strong style=\"text-align:center\"><br></strong></strong><span style=\"text-align:center\">- 模组支持</span></p><p><strong><strong style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/dUMzdKH.png\" width=\"113\" height=\"26\"><br></strong></strong><strong>Chris_XENO<br></strong><strong>BurntToast_<br></strong><strong>Kingybu</strong></p><p><em>特别感谢：</em><strong><em><br></em><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/shrimpsnail/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Shrimpsnail</a><br><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fBeagleNF4O4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">BeagleNF404</a><br>我的支持者们 :)</strong></p><p><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/oklbCS0.png\" width=\"116\" height=\"32\"><br>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.tiktok.com%252f%2540demonjoetv%252fvideo%252f7344793939091803434\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/5upkBgn.png\" width=\"121\" height=\"215\"></a><br>&nbsp;@<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.tiktok.com%252f%2540demonjoetv%252fvideo%252f7344793939091803434\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">demonjoetv</a><br></strong></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><a style=\"color:#e5e5e5\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.tiktok.com%252f%2540shockbyte%252fvideo%252f7379275001075125505\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/zL9qMJv.png\" width=\"122\" height=\"216\"></a><br>&nbsp;@<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.tiktok.com%252f%2540shockbyte%252fvideo%252f7379275001075125505\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">shockbyte</a></p>\n</div><p><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/816/941/more-by-me.png\" alt=\"more by me.png\" width=\"466\" height=\"48\"></strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/colourful-containers-gui\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/816/939/pack2.png\" alt=\"pack2.png\" width=\"98\" height=\"98\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/brewing-guide\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/816/938/pack1.png\" alt=\"pack1.png\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></strong></a><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/kingybus-hud-plus\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/816/940/pack4.png\" alt=\"pack4.png\" width=\"113\" height=\"113\"></a><br></strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fkingybu\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/1ae62cc0-f2ab-4597-88a2-f1c45b3b49ae.webp\" width=\"754\" height=\"125\"></strong></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
